# The files that make up the redistributable jess Renode model of the Pixhawk 6X-RT (i.MX RT1176).
#
# This list IS the archive. tools/renode-model/pack.py packs exactly these, and
# tools/renode-model/verify.sh asserts the unpacked archive holds EXACTLY these plus the two
# files the packer adds — an exact set, not membership, so nothing leaks in and nothing drops out.
#
# Paths are relative to hardware/renode/, and the archive mirrors that directory, so the
# `$ORIGIN`-relative paths in rt1176-smoke.resc resolve inside an unpacked archive from any cwd.
#
# Added by the packer, not listed here:
#   LICENSE              the repository's Apache-2.0 text; a redistributable archive carries it
#   renode-model.toml    generated: version, source commit, tested Renode, fidelity note
#
# Scope (maintainer decision, 2026-10-27, jess#299): the stable core only. Experiment
# directories, bulkmem, the PX4 bring-up extras and the tooling stay out; the PX4 parts follow
# later as their own version.

# platform
pixhawk6xrt.repl
vehicle/rt1176-dualcore.repl
vehicle/README.md

# smoke: the script, the robot suite, and the firmware with the source it was built from
rt1176-smoke.resc
rt1176-smoke.robot
smoke/rt1176-smoke.elf
smoke/boot.S
smoke/link.ld
